      "side": 1,
      "message": "To decouple this from objectLinker, how about:\n\n    if s, ok :\u003d c.linker.(interface{\n        splitPerApliLevel() bool\n    }); ok {\n        return s.splitPerApiLevel()\n    }\n\nAnd then objectLinker can have:\n\n    func (o *objectLinker) splitPerApiLevel() bool {\n        return Bool(o.Properties.Crt)\n    }",
